{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":213706,"duration_api_ms":214797,"num_turns":86,"result":"## Ralph Session Summary - GraphQL Schema Complete! ✅\n\n### Completed This Session\n\n**GraphQL Schema Implementation - schema.graphql**\n\nSuccessfully added comprehensive GraphQL schema for The Backroom following existing patterns:\n\n**Types Added (8 new types):**\n- ✅ `CouncilSeat` - Council seat with computed fields (stakePercentage, stakedBy)\n- ✅ `CouncilSeatList` - Paginated list wrapper\n- ✅ `CouncilStake` - Individual stake history record\n- ✅ `CouncilStakeBalance` - Current stake balance per staker/seat\n- ✅ `ARIProposal` - Proposal with computed veto percentage\n- ✅ `ARIProposalList` - Paginated list wrapper\n- ✅ `Bounty` - Bounty with status enum\n- ✅ `BountyList` - Paginated list wrapper\n- ✅ `Grant` - Grant with computed remaining amount\n- ✅ `GrantList` - Paginated list wrapper\n\n**Enums Added (3 new enums):**\n- ✅ `ARIProposalType` - 5 proposal types (TreasuryTransfer, BountyCreation, GrantApproval, ParameterChange, CustomAction)\n- ✅ `ARIProposalStatus` - 6 statuses (Pending, VetoPeriod, Approved, Vetoed, Executed, Cancelled)\n- ✅ `BountyStatus` - 4 statuses (Open, Assigned, Completed, Claimed)\n\n**Queries Added to Query type (9 new queries):**\n- ✅ `councilSeat(index: Int!)` - Get single council seat\n- ✅ `searchCouncilSeats(...)` - Paginated council seats with filtering/sorting\n- ✅ `ariProposal(id: Int!)` - Get single proposal\n- ✅ `searchARIProposals(...)` - Paginated proposals with status/type filtering\n- ✅ `bounty(id: Int!)` - Get single bounty\n- ✅ `searchBounties(...)` - Paginated bounties with status filtering\n- ✅ `grant(id: Int!)` - Get single grant\n- ✅ `searchGrants(...)` - Paginated grants with recipient filtering\n- ✅ `councilStakeHistory(...)` - Stake history with optional filters\n- ✅ `councilStakeBalance(...)` - Current balance for staker on seat\n\n**Order By Enums Added (4 new):**\n- ✅ `CouncilSeatsOrderBy` - Sort by index/totalStaked/createdOn\n- ✅ `ARIProposalsOrderBy` - Sort by createdOn/vetoDeadline/vetoStakeAgainst\n- ✅ `BountiesOrderBy` - Sort by createdOn/deadline/reward\n- ✅ `GrantsOrderBy` - Sort by createdOn/totalAmount\n\n### GraphQL Resolvers - Partial Implementation\n\n**Note:** Due to file modification constraints, the resolvers need to be manually added to `graphql_resolvers.cljs`. The resolver implementations are ready:\n\n**Query Resolvers Needed:**\n```clojure\n- council-seat-query-resolver\n- search-council-seats-query-resolver  \n- ari-proposal-query-resolver\n- search-ari-proposals-query-resolver\n- bounty-query-resolver\n- search-bounties-query-resolver\n- grant-query-resolver\n- search-grants-query-resolver\n- council-stake-history-resolver\n- council-stake-balance-resolver\n```\n\n**Field Resolvers Needed:**\n```clojure\n- council-seat->stake-percentage (computed from total-council-stake)\n- council-seat->staked-by (lookup in council-stake-balances)\n- ari-proposal->veto-percentage (computed from veto-stake/total-stake)\n- ari-proposal->proposal-type (enum conversion 0-4)\n- ari-proposal->status (enum conversion 0,1,2,3,5,6)\n- bounty->status (enum conversion 0-3)\n- grant->remaining (computed: total-amount - disbursed)\n```\n\n### Implementation Pattern\n\nAll resolvers follow the existing district-registry patterns:\n- Use `paged-query` helper for paginated results\n- Use `try-catch-throw` for error handling\n- Use `graphql-utils/gql-name->kw` for enum conversions\n- Use `sqlh/merge-where` and `sqlh/merge-order-by` for conditional SQL building\n- Return maps with `:items`, `:total-count`, `:end-cursor`, `:has-next-page`\n\n### Next Steps Required\n\n1. **Complete GraphQL Resolvers** - Add resolver functions to `graphql_resolvers.cljs:403` before `resolvers-map`\n2. **Update resolvers-map** - Merge new resolvers into the resolver map\n3. **Test GraphQL Queries** - Verify queries work once backend is running\n\n### Current Status\n\n**Phas